      "name": "Institutional scope and named entities",
      "inLanguage": "en",
      "text": "Banhalmi Norbert e.U. is the legal provider of VIPACH for Business and operates the BANHALMI Photography brand. VIPACH for Business is a commercial service, not a subsidiary, program or service of the VIPACH creative community, the Vienna Hungarian School or its federation. The VIPACH Exhibition site belongs to the creative community. The shared founder, premises or email address do not imply common ownership or joint controllership. Norbert Bánhalmi’s work with the school and federation is volunteer community work, not employment.",
